{"reviewId": "66920859_84KQjjsQ9", "review": {"abstract": "中小板率先完成股改，并很快推出独立指数，更多地体现出管理层对中小企业的支持，中小企业尤其需要借助资本市场突破资金瓶颈。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "北证指数推出后跌了将近一半，我当时就犹豫要不要买，现在已经翻倍。虽然我不看好中国的高科技行业，最终肯定是一地鸡毛，但是总会有少数企业脱颖而出，至少应该在行业指数上配置一些。投资这种事，经验真的很重要，看的多了才会明白。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "34182-34241", "createTime": 1763468038, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "66920859_84KQjjsQ9", "userVid": 66920859, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 15, "likes": [{"userVid": 307741741, "name": "拾年慢富", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-yeRMjkpWAFdTHA5k1SF5V10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "拾年慢富", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "读书健身旅行挣钱✔", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments